      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates to a new Atreia are opening. Secure your Founder’s Pack today and be among the first to begin your adventure! (Limited-time offer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Standard Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/f0fb1bb442c46f0527b86d07d0f0bd3a.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Atreia early with helpful items to start strong.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-Day Advanced Access: Be among the first to enter the world 5 days before the official launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) x1: Contains helpful supplies to support your early-game progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Title [Vanguard of Atreia]: A special Unique-grade title exclusive to your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Quai Membership (30-day Membership): Enjoy special perks such as remote storage, market interaction, and increased reward selection count for dungeons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Deluxe Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/f496c8234921b58891a1b71033b53890.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete package featuring exclusive armor and weapon skins to express your unique style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes all Standard Pack contents (5-Day Advanced Access / Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/ Title / Special Quai Membership (30 Days)).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Daeva (Skin: Set): A distinctive armor skin that blends edgy plate armor with luxurious leather accents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Skin [Eternal Sun Weapon]: A weapon skin featuring special effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Ultimate Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/76dbb16274f70eb3dca31cf37aa8b269.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ultimate premium package that includes 2 skins, a weapon, a pet, and wings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes all Deluxe Pack contents (5-Day Advanced Access / Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/ Title / Ascended Daeva (Skin: Set) (Bound) / Weapon Skin Chest: Eternal Sun (Bound) / Special Quai Membership(30 Days)).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daeva's Styling Chest (Bound) x1: A special styling item chest exclusive to AION 2 Ultimate Founder's Pack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonlit Aria (Skin: Set) (Bound): An elegant armor skin inspired by the icy glow of winter moonlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet [Black Dragon]: A special premium pet that will accompany you on your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blazing Sun Wings (Bound): A dazzling wing skin featuring radiant feathers of gold flames.</p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates to a new Atreia are opening. Secure your Founder’s Pack today and be among the first to begin your adventure! (Limited-time offer)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Standard Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/f0fb1bb442c46f0527b86d07d0f0bd3a.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Atreia early with helpful items to start strong.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-Day Advanced Access: Be among the first to enter the world 5 days before the official launch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) x1: Contains helpful supplies to support your early-game progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Title [Vanguard of Atreia]: A special Unique-grade title exclusive to your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Quai Membership (30-day Membership): Enjoy special perks such as remote storage, market interaction, and increased reward selection count for dungeons!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Deluxe Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/f496c8234921b58891a1b71033b53890.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete package featuring exclusive armor and weapon skins to express your unique style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes all Standard Pack contents (5-Day Advanced Access / Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/ Title / Special Quai Membership (30 Days)).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Daeva (Skin: Set): A distinctive armor skin that blends edgy plate armor with luxurious leather accents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon Skin [Eternal Sun Weapon]: A weapon skin featuring special effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[AION 2 Ultimate Founder's Pack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972180/extras/76dbb16274f70eb3dca31cf37aa8b269.avif?t=1788512660\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ultimate premium package that includes 2 skins, a weapon, a pet, and wings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes all Deluxe Pack contents (5-Day Advanced Access / Daeva's Campaign Supply Chest (Bound) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/ Title / Ascended Daeva (Skin: Set) (Bound) / Weapon Skin Chest: Eternal Sun (Bound) / Special Quai Membership(30 Days)).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daeva's Styling Chest (Bound) x1: A special styling item chest exclusive to AION 2 Ultimate Founder's Pack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonlit Aria (Skin: Set) (Bound): An elegant armor skin inspired by the icy glow of winter moonlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pet [Black Dragon]: A special premium pet that will accompany you on your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blazing Sun Wings (Bound): A dazzling wing skin featuring radiant feathers of gold flames.</p></li></ul>",
